{"requirements":[{"id":"account","requirement":"Create an account named `dropbox` on node1.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The account was created with home `/incoming` and shell `/sbin/nologin`; it remained present with the same identity after restart.","evidence_ids":["cmd-d37a219fda064042","cmd-d0dcba50ae864462"]},{"id":"sftp_only","requirement":"Permit `dropbox` to use SFTP only, without shell or general SSH access.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Effective SSH policy forces `internal-sftp` and disables forwarding, TTY, and tunnels. Live shell attempts were denied both before and after restart while SFTP remained functional.","evidence_ids":["cmd-999b5ce16c1145b5","cmd-950ee706a0cc4ca4","cmd-d0dcba50ae864462"]},{"id":"confinement","requirement":"Confine `dropbox` to `/srv/sftp/dropbox`.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The requested root is root-owned, and live SFTP views it as `/` containing only `incoming`. An attempted read of host `/etc/passwd` failed and produced no retrieved file.","evidence_ids":["cmd-d37a219fda064042","cmd-c4dd1015d7ac4e66","cmd-950ee706a0cc4ca4","cmd-d0dcba50ae864462"]},{"id":"writable_incoming","requirement":"Provide a writable `incoming` directory within the confinement root.","status":"satisfied","summary":"`incoming` is owned by `dropbox:dropbox` with mode 0750. Multiple live SFTP uploads, downloads, checksum checks, and removals succeeded, including after restart; the final directory was empty and write-tested.","evidence_ids":["cmd-d37a219fda064042","cmd-c4dd1015d7ac4e66","cmd-d0dcba50ae864462","cmd-9e53ae3209d94839"]}],"confidence":1,"operational_hygiene":{"score":0.9,"summary":"All substantive system mutations supported account setup, SSH/SELinux configuration, validation, correction of the discovered authorized-key permission problem, or the mandatory restart protocol. Restart evidence is complete: healthy pre-state, acknowledged restart, changed boot identity, recovered system/SSH/SFTP state, persistent data, and matching lifecycle boot IDs. The deduction is for unnecessary retained temporary residue: `/tmp/ssh_selinux.man` from `cmd-b3e6e784925640fa`; the probe and success-batch files from `cmd-2a28e8018eec4a99`; the roundtrip file from `cmd-c4dd1015d7ac4e66`; three shell/confinement-test files from `cmd-950ee706a0cc4ca4`; two pre-restart files from `cmd-76a49f856ab94582`; three post-restart files from `cmd-d0dcba50ae864462`; and two final-probe files from `cmd-9e53ae3209d94839`. These remained under `/tmp`. Validation files inside `incoming` were reverted by the final cleanup, and no failed services, package damage, or additional listening services were observed.","evidence_ids":["cmd-b3e6e784925640fa","cmd-2a28e8018eec4a99","cmd-c4dd1015d7ac4e66","cmd-950ee706a0cc4ca4","cmd-76a49f856ab94582","cmd-148a52285d9e45f0","cmd-3643fb21e2cc4f63","cmd-d0dcba50ae864462","cmd-9e53ae3209d94839","global:before_prepare:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity","global:before_prepare:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material outcomes are satisfied. The `dropbox` account has working SFTP-only access, is confined to `/srv/sftp/dropbox`, and can write to `incoming`; shell and host-filesystem access are denied. The provider restart protocol was fully demonstrated and cross-checked. Only low-risk abandoned `/tmp` validation artifacts reduce operational hygiene.","limitations":[]}
